!
! The people coming to a gathering (bonfire_rules.h BR3), in Trebago: the
! exact sum of each guest's party where the guest's answer is yes, one
! guest per row; answer 0 none yet, 1 yes, 2 no, 3 maybe, party 1 to 99
! (the guest and who comes with them). yes(i) is 1 exactly when the
! answer is 1. ok is 1 when party is 1..99 and answer 0..3, else 0, and
! each row is divided by it: anything outside refuses the whole sum.
trebago headcount
  in  party(n), answer(n)
  out total
  var ok(n), yes(n)
  ok(i) = min(1, max(0, party(i))) * min(1, max(0, 99 - party(i) + 1)) &
        * min(1, max(0, answer(i) + 1)) * min(1, max(0, 3 - answer(i) + 1))
  yes(i) = max(0, min(1, answer(i))) * max(0, min(1, 2 - answer(i)))
  total = sum(i, party(i) * yes(i) / ok(i))
end
